==Behind the scenes==
{{Quote|As for how it happened&hellip; I kept trying to sneak Hoojibs in until they let me do it properly.|Cavan Scott|<ref name="Cavan Scott Twitter">{{Twitter|username=cavanscott|url=status/1427403121303736324|name=[[Cavan Scott]]|date=2021-08-16|quote=The cover is by Arianna Florean. As for how it happened… I kept trying to sneak Hoojibs in until they let me do it properly.|archivedate=20210817015618}}</ref>}}
Hoojibs first appeared in the new ''[[Star Wars]]'' [[canon]] in a [[Star Wars comic books|comic]] [[The Hoojib Menace|story]] written by [[Cavan Scott]], illustrated by [[Arianna Florean]], and published in [[IDW Publishing]]'s [[Star Wars Adventures Annual 2021|''Star Wars Adventures Annual'' 2021]] in [[November]] [[2021]].<ref name="Adventures Annual 2021" /> The [[Hoojib/Legends|species]] originally debuted in the [[Star Wars Legends|''Star Wars'' Legends]] continuity in the [[1981]] comic [[Star Wars (1977) 55|''Star Wars'' (1977) 55]], written by [[David Michelinie]], penciled by [[Walter Simonson]], and published by [[Marvel Comics]].<ref name="Star Wars 55">[[Star Wars (1977) 55|''Star Wars'' (1977) 55]]</ref>

